# IDE - VSCode
.vscode

globalConfig.json

# Review agents' notes stay off this public repository: they record findings and internals
# that do not belong in it (decided 2026-11-01). No trailing slash: the lt-memory plugin links
# the directory in as a symlink, which git treats as a file, and `agent-memory/` would miss it.
**/.claude/agent-memory

# Claude Code runtime state
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
